"see I</sys/bus/event_source/devices/[k,u]probe/format/retprobe>)  for "
"kretprobe/uretprobe.  See fields I<kprobe_func>, I<uprobe_path>, "
"I<kprobe_addr>, and I<probe_offset> for more details."
