msgstr ""

#.  commit fa7315871046b9a4c48627905691dbde57e51033
#. type: Plain text
#: build/C/man2/perf_event_open.2:1819
msgid ""
"Starting with Linux 3.12, these are renamed to I<cap_bit0> and you should "
