"Note that SPARC systems have the meaning of I<data> and I<addr>\n"
"reversed; that is, I<data> is ignored and the registers are copied\n"
"from the address I<addr>.  B<PTRACE_SETREGS> and B<PTRACE_SETFPREGS>\n"
